==Bulgarian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|bg|sla-pro|*sę}}, from {{inh|bg|ine-bsl-pro|*sen}}, from {{inh|bg|ine-pro|*swé}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{bg-IPA}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|bg|pronoun}}

# {{lb|bg|reflexive pronoun|clitic}} {{n-g|the accusative short form of the [[reflexive pronoun]] {{m|bg|себе си}}, part of [[reflexive verbs]], denoting that the subject is simultaneously the direct object; corresponds to [[myself]], [[yourself]], [[himself]], [[herself]], [[itself]], [[ourselves]], [[yourselves]], [[themselves]]}}
#: {{ux|bg|[[обичам|Обичам]] '''се'''.|I love '''myself'''.}}
#: {{ux|bg|[[обичам|Обича]] '''се'''.|He/She/It loves '''himself/herself/itself'''.}}
# {{lb|bg|reciprocal|clitic}} {{n-g|accusative [[reciprocal pronoun]], denoting that the agents perform the mutual actions among themselves; corresponds to [[each other]], [[one another]]}}
#: {{syn|bg|един друг}}
#: {{ux|bg|Мария [[и]] Петър '''се''' [[обичам|обичат]].|Maria and Petar love '''each other'''.}}
# {{lb|bg|reflexive pronoun|clitic}} {{n-g|[[reflexive pronoun]], part of [[w:Autocausative verb|autocausative verbs]], denoting that the referent represented by the subject combines the activity of actor and undergoes a change of state like a patient}}
#: {{ux|bg|Петър '''се''' [[обиди]].|Petаr became/was offended.}}
# {{lb|bg|reflexive pronoun|clitic}} {{n-g|[[reflexive pronoun]], part of [[w:Anticausative verb|anticausative verbs]], denoting that the subject of the verb undergoes an action or change of state whose agent is unclear or nonexistent}}
#: {{ux|bg|[[врата|Вратата]] '''се''' [[отвори]].|The door was opened.}}
# {{lb|bg|reflexive pronoun|clitic}} {{n-g|used for passive constructions with transitive verbs and undetermined agent}}
#: {{ux|bg|[[от|От]] [[моята]] [[къща]] '''се''' [[вижда]] [[морето]].|From my house one can see the sea.}}
#: {{ux|bg|[[говоря|Говори]] '''се''', [[че]]...|It is said that...}}
# {{lb|bg|reflexive pronoun|clitic}} {{n-g|used for passive constructions with transitive verbs and determined agent}}
#: {{ux|bg|[[писмото|Писмото]] '''се''' [[пише]] [[от]] [[мен]].|The letter is being written by me.}}
#: {{ux|bg|[[къща|Къщата]] '''се''' [[проектира]] [[от]] [[известен]] [[архитект]].|The house was designed by a famous architect.}}
# {{lb|bg|reflexive pronoun|clitic}} {{n-g|inherent part of an [[unergative]] reflexive or reciprocal verb with no meaning of its own, and an obligatory part of the verb's lexical entry}}
#: {{ux|bg|[[гордея|Гордея]] '''се''' [[с]] [[работа|работата]] [[на]] [[Сиву]] [[в]] [[училище]].|I am proud of Sivu's schoolwork.}}
#: {{ux|bg|[[тя|Тя]] '''се''' [[надява]] [[да]] [[спечели]] [[златния]] [[медал]].|She is hoping to win the gold medal.}}

